      "parameters": {"content": "## C500 Lab 3 — two-phase approval\nDraft mode may call the model but never HeyGen. Render mode bypasses the model and uses native Crypto nodes to recompute SHA-256 over the exact approved script. It also preserves and renders the approved disclosure. Select learner-owned credentials and authorised avatar/voice IDs. Never reconnect a polling loop to Create.", "height": 240, "width": 520, "color": 5},
